  "description": "PostgreSQL reports reread the authoritative current row and public visibility under shared site mutation admission, increment counts and union reasons while preserving current content and moderation attribution; threshold three moves approved comments to spam. Demo reporting is synchronous single-process only. Canonical data.completionWarnings is always an array, including empty. Committed content survives activity, configured delivery (thrown or returned failed outcome), and operator audit follow-up failures; safe COMMENT_ACTIVITY_PENDING, COMMENT_DELIVERY_PENDING, COMMENT_AUDIT_PENDING codes identify follow-up work. No automatic replay or durable retry guarantee; responses are no-store and do not expose provider errors."
